<title>USA: Western Digital board oks stock repurchase.</title>
<headline>Western Digital board oks stock repurchase.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Digital Corp said its board of directors has authorized the repurchase of an additional five million shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>Under two prior authorizations, the company has bought 10.5 million of its shares for $243.8 million since February 1995.</p>
</text>
